AbraFlexi ClientZone for Debian
===============================

Package installs the web application to /usr/share/abraflexi-clientzone/
and an Apache alias/configuration for /clientzone/.

Configuration is stored in /etc/abraflexi-client-zone/.env (written by
debconf during package configuration).

Translations (gettext domain "clientzone") are installed under
/usr/share/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/clientzone.mo.

After login, customers are redirected to dashboard.php (relationship
summary, unpaid invoices with reminder dates, open orders).

There is no in-app administrator role. Customers authenticate as AbraFlexi
contacts and only see their own company's data. Privileged configuration is
done by editing /etc/abraflexi-client-zone/.env over SSH (or in AbraFlexi).

